      "text": "Detectar y corregir el error",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Detectar y corregir el error",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "kUYfXLkelcSPFEkY-3Ked",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 237.43507943156646,
      "y": 3882.608040608044,
      "width": 1039.523490190869,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1l",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 944622317,
      "version": 220,
      "versionNonce": 698802659,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794081361879,
      "created": 1794081318106,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "El resto x² es el síndrome de un error simple en la posición x² (coincide con x² mod g , y 2 < n−k = 10 ). \n\nSe cambia ese bit: R(x) +",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "El resto x² es el síndrome de un error simple en la posición x² (coincide con x² mod g , y 2 < n−k = 10 ). \n\nSe cambia ese bit: R(x) +",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Ld5xidK9jbVR5Tt5ZuaQq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 495.1811409956447,
      "y": 3932.610372167686,
      "width": 750.019775390625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 343565923,
      "version": 287,
      "versionNonce": 667322371,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794081367031,
      "created": 1794081318106,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "x² = g(x) → 11010001101000 , resto 0 → válida (es la palabra para i(x) = 1 ).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "x² = g(x) → 11010001101000 , resto 0 → válida (es la palabra para i(x) = 1 ).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sCL1eQVZO5RZgftS4bbrl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 210.7795152355818,
