      "seed": 1545933603,
      "version": 463,
      "versionNonce": 184326723,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794088965719,
      "created": 1794088238323,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Contarlos da φ(40): hay 16 elementos, así que φ(40) = 16.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Contarlos da φ(40): hay 16 elementos, así que φ(40) = 16.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s63OO5fa74VfXaDHOxWGs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 562.357365126677,
      "y": 10058.82278330213,
      "width": 723.8405151367188,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 851666061,
      "version": 424,
      "versionNonce": 1301699043,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794088965719,
      "created": 1794088238323,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Chequeo con la fórmula: 40·(1 − ½)·(1 − ⅕) = 40·½·⅘ = 16 ✔ coincide con el\nconteo.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Chequeo con la fórmula: 40·(1 − ½)·(1 − ⅕) = 40·½·⅘ = 16 ✔ coincide con el conteo.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Z1bLrIbX98tAb0M_fmjxp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560.0599873953975,
      "y": 10118.474670889416,
      "width": 777.9395141601562,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1492956867,
      "version": 450,
      "versionNonce": 35071363,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794088965719,
      "created": 1794088238324,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Chequeo contando lo tachado: de los 39 números, hay 19 pares, 7 múltiplos de 5\n(5, 10, …, 35) y 3 múltiplos de ambos (10, 20, 30, que se contaron dos veces).\nTachados: 19 + 7 − 3 = 23, y 39 − 23 = 16 ✔.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Chequeo contando lo tachado: de los 39 números, hay 19 pares, 7 múltiplos de 5 (5, 10, …, 35) y 3 múltiplos de ambos (10, 20, 30, que se contaron dos veces). Tachados: 19 + 7 − 3 = 23, y 39 − 23 = 16 ✔.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "59BgNZRWPMOYFMPsL1HPJ",
      "type": "line",
