      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794440361256,
      "created": 1794440356952,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "R(x) = 1 + x + x² + x³ + x⁷ + x⁸ + x¹⁰ . Se divide por G(x) (14 bits: 11010001101000 ); \n\nR ⊕ G = 00100000000000 , es decir resto",
      "fontSize": 59.29126536592105,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "R(x) = 1 + x + x² + x³ + x⁷ + x⁸ + x¹⁰ . Se divide por G(x) (14 bits: 11010001101000 ); \n\nR ⊕ G = 00100000000000 , es decir resto",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
